===Etymology 2===
{{PIE word|en|úd}}
{{dercat|en|gem-pro}}
From {{inh|en|enm|outren}}, {{m|enm|utteren|t=to display for sale; to market; to sell; to say, speak; to put into words, express, tell; to make known, reveal}},<ref>{{R:MED Online|entry=ǒutren|pos=''v.''(1)|noformat=1|id=MED31353}}</ref> partly:<ref>{{R:OED Online|pos=''v.''{{sup|1}}|noformat=1|id=1458056587|date=December 2024|nodot=1}}; {{R:Lexico|alt=utter{{sup|2}}|pos=v}}</ref>

* from {{m|enm|outre}}, {{m|enm|utter|pos=adjective, adverb}} (see [[#Etymology 1|etymology 1]] and [[#Etymology 3|etymology 3]]) + {{m|enm|-en|pos={{glossary|suffix}} forming the {{glossary|infinitive}}s of {{glossary|verb}}s}};<ref>{{R:MED Online|entry=-en|pos=''suf.''(3)|noformat=1|id=MED13518}}</ref> and
* from {{der|en|dum|uteren|t=to announce, make known}} (modern {{cog|nl|uiteren}}); or from {{der|en|gml|üteren}}, {{m|gml|ütern|t=to demonstrate, show; to speak; to sell; etc.}} (modern {{cog|nds|ütern}}), from {{der|en|odt|-}} or {{der|en|osx|ūtan}}, probably from {{der|en|gmw-pro|*ūtanā|t=from outside or without; outside of}}. Compare {{cog|gmh|ūzeren}}, whence {{cog|de|äußern|t=to express, say, utter}})

