===Adverb===
{{en-adv|-}}

# Towards a (higher) position closer to the [[sky]] than the [[ground]].
#: {{co|en|look '''upwards'''}}
#: {{co|en|push '''upwards'''}}
#: {{co|en|soar '''upwards'''}}
#: {{ux|en|The balloon drifted '''upwards''' into the sky.}}
